const vhfLabels={gx2400:'Standard Horizon GX2400E · GPS + AIS RX',unknown:'Model encara per confirmar',ray:'Ray53 / Ray63 / Ray73 · SeaTalkng',n2k:'Una altra VHF · NMEA 2000','0183':'VHF amb NMEA 0183'};

let config;try{config=validateProject(JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))||defaults)}catch{config=structuredClone(defaults)}
const knownEquipment={vhf:'gx2400',instrument:'BidataWind',ais:'builtin',networkBridge:true,plotter:true};
try{if(localStorage.getItem('bord-hardware-axiom-v1')!=='applied'){Object.assign(config,knownEquipment);localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(config));localStorage.setItem('bord-hardware-axiom-v1','applied')}}catch{}
let layer='nav',page='atlas',selected={type:'node',id:'i40'},zoom=1,routeKey='',step=0,search='',toastTimer,registration;
const symbols={battery:'▤',fuse:'⏛',switch:'⏚',panel:'▥',shunt:'≋',bus:'═',load:'◉',source:'↯',charger:'⇄',antenna:'⌁',connector:'⋈',radio:'▣',instrument:'▧'};
const geometryCache=new Map();
let sceneSize={w:1,h:1},lastScene=null,lastGeometry=null,fitted=false;
const color={positive:'#ce644d',negative:'#617784',charge:'#45877d',network:'#4b8db0',seatalk:'#be9c2a',sensor:'#8c75ad',rf:'#ad7950',gnss:'#508e8f',ac:'#9569a3',earth:'#78913b',solar:'#ba922f',permanent:'#be7641',nmea0183:'#4c80a0',isolation:'#6b8198',fivevolt:'#b68642',usbdata:'#709778'};
function toast(msg){$('#toast').textContent=msg;$('#toast').hidden=false;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').hidden=true,4500)}
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(config));return true}catch{toast('No s’ha pogut desar al navegador. Exporta el projecte JSON.');return false}}
function sourceLink(key){const s=sources[key];return s?`<a href="${s.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(s.name)} ↗</a>`:''}
function visibleNodes(){return modelNodes(config).filter(n=>n.layer===layer&&enabled(n.condition,config));}
function routes(){return {
 i40:{layer:'nav',ids:config.instrument==='BidataWind'?(hasNetwork(config)?['n1','st-bidata','st-converter','n3',...(hasPlotter(config)?['n6']:[])]:['n1','st-bidata','st-wind']):['n1','n2','n3','n6'],label:config.instrument==='BidataWind'?'Bidata comparteix la velocitat de corredera amb Wind per SeaTalk':'Transductor → i40 → convertidor → xarxa → pantalla'},
 wind:{layer:'nav',ids:config.instrument==='BidataWind'?['windSensor','st-wind',...(hasNetwork(config)?['st-converter','n3',...(hasPlotter(config)?['n6']:[])]:[])]:[],label:'Rotavecta → i40 Wind; dades de velocitat rebudes de Bidata'},
 gps:{layer:'nav',steps:config.vhf==='gx2400'?[{type:'node',id:'vhf'},...(hasNetwork(config)?[{type:'edge',id:'gxn2k'}]:[])]:null,ids:config.vhf==='gx2400'?(hasNetwork(config)?['gxn2k']:[]):config.vhf==='0183'?['n5','n11','n12']:config.vhf==='unknown'?['n5']:['n5','n4'],label:config.vhf==='gx2400'?'GPS intern de la GX2400E per a DSC; exportació opcional a la xarxa':config.vhf==='unknown'?'Font de posició: falta confirmar la interfície de la VHF':'La posició arriba de la font GNSS, no de l’i40'},
 rf:{layer:'nav',ids:config.ais==='external'?['r1','r3','r4','r5']:['r1','r2'],label:'Radiofreqüència: antena, baixant i emissora'},
 bilge:{layer:'dc',ids:['d21','d22','d23','return5','d5','d4'],label:'Alimentació permanent: la sentina no depèn del general'},
 shunt:{layer:'dc',ids:['return2','d5','d4','dsense'],label:'Retorn de serveis pel shunt; fil Vbatt+ protegit'},
 gas:{layer:'dc',ids:config.gasAlarm?['g1','g2','g4','g3']:[],label:'Central de gas autònoma amb alimentació permanent'},
 computer:{layer:'dc',ids:config.computer?['p1','p3','p4','p5','p6','p7']:[],label:'12 V → convertidor → Raspberry i hub → dues webcams USB'},
 shore:{layer:'ac',ids:config.transformer?['a1','t1','t2','tmag','tout','tpeout','a3','acload0','a7']:['a1','a2','a3','acload0','pe0','a7'],label:config.transformer?'Port → primari → aïllament → secundari protegit → carregador':'Entrada AC amb PE continu i carregador a serveis'}
 };}
function routeSteps(r){return r?.steps||r?.ids.map(id=>({type:'edge',id}))||[];}
function scenario(){return powerState(config);}

function stateFor(n){const s=scenario();if(n.layer==='dc'){
 if(['lights','cabin','fridge','water','electronics','windlass','usb','autopilot','panel'].includes(n.id))return s.services;
 if(['gasfuse','gasalarm','gasprobe'].includes(n.id))return s.gasAvailable;if(['piconverter','raspberry','usbhub','camera1','camera2'].includes(n.id))return s.computer;if(n.id==='bilge')return s.bilge;if(n.id==='main')return config.main;if(n.id==='motor'||n.id==='dcdc')return config.engine;if(n.id==='solar'||n.id==='mppt')return config.solar;return true;
 }if(n.layer==='ac')return ['pe','galvanic'].includes(n.id)?null:config.shore;if(['vhf','i40','converter','backbone','plotter','netpower','aisunit','splitter','gps','gateway','navdc','i40Wind','st1bus','st1power'].includes(n.id))return s.services;return null;}
function switchLayer(next){const changed=layer!==next;layer=next;zoom=1;fitted=false;if(changed){const box=$('#diagramScroll');if(box){box.scrollLeft=0;box.scrollTop=0}}$$('[data-layer]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',b.dataset.layer===layer));if(!visibleNodes().some(n=>n.id===selected.id))selected={type:'node',id:layer==='nav'?'i40':layer==='dc'?'house':'shore'};draw();showDetail();}
function choose(type,id,scroll=false){selected={type,id};draw();showDetail();revealSelected();if(scroll&&matchMedia('(max-width:850px)').matches)$('#inspector').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}
function svg(tag,attrs,parent,text){const el=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg',tag);for(const [k,v]of Object.entries(attrs))el.setAttribute(k,v);if(text!==undefined)el.textContent=text;parent?.append(el);return el;}
function draw(){const meta=layers[layer],root=$('#diagram');root.replaceChildren();$('#mapTitle').textContent=meta.title;$('#mapSub').textContent=meta.sub;
 const ns=visibleNodes(),r=routes()[routeKey],routeIds=r?.ids||[],focusNodes=new Set(routeIds.flatMap(id=>{const e=byEdge(id);return e?[e.from,e.to]:[]}));
 let es=activeEdges(config,layer).filter(e=>$('#returns').checked||e.type!=='negative');
 const scene=layoutDiagram(ns),cacheKey=layer+':'+es.map(e=>e.id).join(',');
 let geometry=geometryCache.get(cacheKey);if(!geometry){geometry=routeDiagram(scene,es);geometryCache.set(cacheKey,geometry);if(geometryCache.size>24)geometryCache.delete(geometryCache.keys().next().value)}
 root.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${scene.width} ${scene.height}`);sceneSize={w:scene.width,h:scene.height};lastScene=scene;lastGeometry=geometry;applyZoom();
 $('#nodeCount').textContent=ns.length+' equips · '+es.length+' connexions';
 const defs=svg('defs',{},root);for(const [kind,c]of Object.entries(color)){const m=svg('marker',{id:'arrow-'+kind,viewBox:'0 0 10 10',refX:9,refY:5,markerWidth:5,markerHeight:5,orient:'auto-start-reverse'},defs);svg('path',{d:'M0 0L10 5L0 10Z',fill:c},m);}
 const rank=e=>selected.type==='edge'&&selected.id===e.id?3:routeIds.includes(e.id)?2:selected.type==='node'&&(e.from===selected.id||e.to===selected.id)?1:0;
 for(const e of [...es].sort((a,b)=>rank(a)-rank(b))){
 const a=byId(e.from),b=byId(e.to),wire=geometry.get(e.id),d=wire.d,lx=wire.label.x,ly=wire.label.y-8;
 const match=!search||[e.id,e.label,e.connector,a.name,b.name].some(value=>value.toLowerCase().includes(search)||translate(value).toLowerCase().includes(search));
 const related=selected.type==='node'&&(e.from===selected.id||e.to===selected.id),sel=selected.type==='edge'&&selected.id===e.id;
 const g=svg('g',{class:'edge'+(sel?' selected':'')+(routeIds.includes(e.id)?' route':'')+(!match?' dim':'')+($('#focusWires').checked&&!sel&&!related&&!routeIds.includes(e.id)?' context':''),tabindex:0,role:'button','aria-label':`${e.id} · ${a.name} → ${b.name} · ${e.label}`},root);
 svg('title',{},g,`${e.id}: ${a.name} → ${b.name} (${e.label}) · ${translate(cableSpec(e).type)} · ${config.cables[e.id]?.area?config.cables[e.id].area+' mm²':translate(cableSpec(e).size)}`);svg('path',{d,class:'wire-halo'},g);svg('path',{d,stroke:color[e.type],class:'edge-visible'+(e.type==='isolation'?' magnetic-coupling':''),'marker-end':`url(#arrow-${e.type})`,...(related?{style:'opacity:.95;stroke-width:3'}:{})},g);svg('path',{d,class:'edge-hit'},g);
 if(sel||related||routeIds.includes(e.id))svg('text',{x:lx,y:ly,class:'edge-label','text-anchor':'middle'},g,sel&&wire.label.length>140?e.id+' · '+e.label:e.id);
 g.addEventListener('click',()=>choose('edge',e.id,true));g.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(['Enter',' '].includes(event.key)){event.preventDefault();choose('edge',e.id,true)}});
 }
 for(const n of scene.nodes){const match=!search||[n.id,n.name,n.sub,n.detail].some(value=>value.toLowerCase().includes(search)||translate(value).toLowerCase().includes(search)),on=stateFor(n),sel=selected.type==='node'&&selected.id===n.id;
 const g=svg('g',{class:'node'+(sel?' selected':'')+(focusNodes.has(n.id)?' route':'')+(!match?' dim':'')+(on===false?' off':''),transform:`translate(${n.x} ${n.y})`,tabindex:0,role:'button','aria-label':n.name+' · '+n.sub},root);
 svg('title',{},g,n.name+' · dibuix orientatiu');
 svg('rect',{width:n.width,height:n.height,rx:12,class:'node-hit'},g);
 svg('text',{x:140,y:18,class:'node-name','text-anchor':'middle'},g,n.name);
 svg('text',{x:140,y:36,class:'node-sub','text-anchor':'middle'},g,n.id==='i40'?'SeaTalk 1 · i40 '+(config.instrument==='BidataWind'?'Bidata':config.instrument):n.sub);
 // Els cables arriben a la silueta; el tram interior queda darrere del dibuix.
 for(const e of es.filter(e=>e.from===n.id||e.to===n.id)){
  const wire=geometry.get(e.id),p=e.from===n.id?wire.a:wire.b,x=p.x-n.x,y=p.y-n.y;
  svg('path',{d:`M${x} ${y} H140`,stroke:color[e.type],class:'component-lead'+(e.type==='isolation'?' magnetic-coupling':'')+($('#focusWires').checked&&selected.id!==n.id&&selected.id!==e.id&&!routeIds.includes(e.id)?' muted':'')},g);
 }
 svg('image',{x:30,y:43,width:220,height:125,href:artUrl(n.id),class:'component-art','aria-hidden':'true'},g);
 svg('circle',{cx:53,cy:175,r:3,class:'state-dot',...(on===null?{style:'fill:#9cafa8'}:{})},g);
 svg('text',{x:62,y:178,class:'node-state'},g,on===null?'CONNEXIÓ / PASSIU':on?'ALIMENTACIÓ DISPONIBLE':'INACTIU / SENSE ALIMENTACIÓ');
 for(const e of es.filter(e=>e.from===n.id||e.to===n.id)){
  const wire=geometry.get(e.id),p=e.from===n.id?wire.a:wire.b,x=p.x-n.x,y=p.y-n.y;
  svg('rect',{x:x-3,y:y-3,width:6,height:6,rx:1,fill:color[e.type],class:'wire-terminal'},g);
  if(selected.id===n.id||selected.id===e.id)svg('text',{x:x+(p.side==='left'?-7:7),y:y-5,'text-anchor':p.side==='left'?'end':'start',class:'terminal-code'},g,e.id);
 }
 g.addEventListener('click',()=>choose('node',n.id,true));g.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(['Enter',' '].includes(event.key)){event.preventDefault();choose('node',n.id,true)}});
 }
 $('#equipmentButtons').innerHTML=ns.map(n=>`<button data-node="${n.id}">${esc(n.name)}</button>`).join('');$$('[data-node]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>choose('node',b.dataset.node,true));
 $('#routeStep').textContent=r?`${step+1} / ${routeSteps(r).length}`:'Exploració lliure';$('#previous').disabled=!r||step===0;$('#next').disabled=!r||step===routeSteps(r).length-1;
}
function showDetail(){const target=$('#detail');if(selected.type==='node'){
 const n=byId(selected.id);if(!n)return;const es=activeEdges(config).filter(e=>e.from===n.id||e.to===n.id),s=stateFor(n);
 target.innerHTML=`<div class="component-preview"><img src="${artUrl(n.id)}" alt="Dibuix orientatiu de ${esc(n.name)}"><span>Il·lustració orientativa · no és un pinout</span></div><p class="eyebrow">${esc(layers[n.layer].name)} / EQUIP</p><h2>${esc(n.name)}</h2><p>${esc(n.detail)}</p>${['i40','i40Wind'].includes(n.id)?i40Detail(n.id==='i40Wind'?'Wind':config.instrument==='BidataWind'?'Bidata':config.instrument):''}${n.id==='vhf'?`<p class="small">Perfil: ${esc(vhfLabels[config.vhf])}${config.ais==='builtin'&&config.vhf==='ray'?' · AIS integrat: Ray73 en el perfil Raymarine; receptor, no transceptor.':''}</p>`:''}<div class="detail-section"><h3>PORTS I BORNS</h3><ul class="port-list">${n.ports.map(p=>`<li>${esc(p)}</li>`).join('')}</ul></div><div class="detail-section"><h3>CONNEXIONS · TOCA’N UNA</h3>${es.map(e=>`<button class="link-button" data-edge="${e.id}">${esc(e.id)} · ${esc(byId(e.from).name)} → ${esc(byId(e.to).name)}<br><small>${esc(e.label)}</small></button>`).join('')||'<p>Cap connexió activa en aquest perfil.</p>'}</div><div class="detail-section"><p class="small">${sourceLink(n.source)}</p></div>${noteEditor(n.id)}`;
 }else{const e=byEdge(selected.id);if(!e)return;
 target.innerHTML=`<div class="detail-symbol">↔</div><p class="eyebrow">CONNEXIÓ ${esc(e.id)} / ${esc(layers[e.layer].name)}</p><h2>${esc(e.label)}</h2>${routeKey?`<p class="small">${esc(routes()[routeKey].label)} · pas ${step+1}</p>`:''}<div class="endpoint"><small>EXTREM A · ${esc(byId(e.from).name)}</small><strong>${esc(e.a)}</strong></div><div class="endpoint"><small>EXTREM B · ${esc(byId(e.to).name)}</small><strong>${esc(e.b)}</strong></div><dl class="connection-detail"><dt>Connector / adaptador</dt><dd>${esc(e.connector)}</dd><dt>Cable</dt><dd>${esc(e.cable)}</dd><dt>Protecció i condicions</dt><dd>${esc(e.protection)}</dd></dl><div class="detail-section"><button class="link-button" data-node="${e.from}">Veure ${esc(byId(e.from).name)} →</button><button class="link-button" data-node="${e.to}">Veure ${esc(byId(e.to).name)} →</button></div>${wireSpecEditor(e)}${isDCWire(e)?cableEditor(e):''}<div class="detail-section"><p class="small">${sourceLink(byId(e.to).source)}</p></div>${noteEditor(e.id)}`;
 }
 target.querySelectorAll('[data-edge]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>choose('edge',b.dataset.edge));target.querySelectorAll('[data-node]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>choose('node',b.dataset.node));
 const note=$('#elementNote');if(note)note.oninput=()=>{config.notes[selected.id]=note.value;save()};
 $$('#detail [data-cable]').forEach(input=>input.oninput=()=>{const values={...(config.cables[selected.id]||{})};values[input.dataset.cable]=input.type==='number'?(input.value===''?'':Number(input.value)):input.value;config.cables[selected.id]=values;save();updateCalc();});updateCalc();
}
function noteEditor(id){return `<div class="detail-section"><label for="elementNote">Notes del teu muntatge<textarea id="elementNote" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Model, referència, ubicació, verificació pendent…">${esc(config.notes[id]||'')}</textarea></label><p class="small">Desat localment en aquest navegador. Exporta JSON per conservar-ne una còpia.</p></div>`;}
function i40Detail(instrument=config.instrument){const types=instrument==='Bidata'?['Depth','Speed']:[instrument];return `<div class="detail-section"><h3>TRANSDUCTOR · i40 ${esc(instrument)}</h3>${types.map(t=>`<p class="small">${esc(t)}</p><dl class="connection-detail">${transducers[t].map(([c,f])=>`<dt>${esc(c)}</dt><dd>${esc(f)}</dd>`).join('')}</dl>`).join('')}<p class="small">Pales d’1/8″ indicades al manual. Aquest és el mapa de funcions del transductor, no un pinout de SeaTalk. Utilitza la numeració i el dibuix posterior del teu instrument.</p></div>`;}
function isDCWire(e){return !['dsense','n8','st-feed','st-supply'].includes(e.id)&&['positive','negative','permanent','charge'].includes(e.type)&&!(e.layer==='ac'&&e.type!=='charge')}
function wireSpecEditor(e){const spec=cableSpec(e),c=config.cables[e.id]||{};if(e.type==='isolation')return `<div class="detail-section"><p>${esc(spec.type)}</p></div>`;
 return `<div class="detail-section"><h3>FITXA DEL CABLE I TERMINACIONS</h3><dl class="connection-detail"><dt>Tipus de cable</dt><dd>${esc(spec.type)}</dd><dt>Secció / calibre</dt><dd>${c.area?`<span data-user-text>${esc(c.area)} mm²</span> · `:''}${esc(spec.size)}</dd><dt>Connector extrem A</dt><dd>${esc(spec.connectorA)}</dd><dt>Connector extrem B</dt><dd>${esc(spec.connectorB)}</dd></dl><p class="small">La fitxa descriu el cable de cada línia funcional. Un traç pot agrupar diversos conductors o ramals; compta’ls abans de comprar.</p>${[['wireType','Referència o tipus de cable escollit'],['gauge','Calibre / composició escollits'],['connectorA','Connector A escollit'],['connectorB','Connector B escollit']].map(([key,label])=>`<label>${label}<input data-cable="${key}" maxlength="240" value="${esc(c[key]||'')}" placeholder="Pendent de confirmar al muntatge"></label>`).join('')}</div>`;
}
function cableEditor(e){const c=config.cables[e.id]||{};return `<div class="detail-section"><h3>ANOTA I ESTIMA LA CAIGUDA DC</h3><div class="calc-fields">${[['length','Llargada d’anada · m'],['current','Corrent · A'],['area','Secció · mm²'],['voltage','Tensió · V'],['percent','Caiguda màxima de disseny · %']].map(([key,label])=>`<label>${label}<input type="number" min="${['area','voltage','percent'].includes(key)?'.01':'0'}" max="100000" step="any" data-cable="${key}" value="${esc(c[key]??(key==='voltage'?12:key==='percent'?3:''))}"></label>`).join('')}</div><p id="sectionResult" class="calc-result" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="calcResult" class="calc-result" aria-live="polite"></p><label>Protecció prevista · pendent de validar<input data-cable="fuse" maxlength="120" placeholder="Tipus, calibre i poder de tall" value="${esc(c.fuse||'')}"></label><p class="small">ΔV = 2 × L × I × 0,0175 / S. Coure a 20 °C, anada i tornada iguals; sense resistència de connexions. No dimensiona ampacitat, arrencada ni proteccions.</p></div>`;}
function updateCalc(){const r=$('#calcResult');if(!r)return;const c=config.cables[selected.id]||{},hint=$('#sectionResult');if(hint){hint.textContent='Introdueix llargada i corrent per obtenir una secció mínima per caiguda de tensió.';if(['length','current'].every(k=>c[k]!==undefined&&c[k]!=='')){try{const m=minimumSection({length:Number(c.length),current:Number(c.current),voltage:Number(c.voltage??12),percent:Number(c.percent??3)});hint.textContent=translate('Mínim només per caiguda de tensió')+`: ${m.minimum.toFixed(2)} mm² · `+translate('Secció comercial superior')+`: ${m.standard??'—'} mm². `+translate('Cal verificar ampacitat, temperatura, agrupament, arrencada i fusible abans de validar.')}catch{hint.textContent=translate('Revisa llargada, corrent, tensió i percentatge.')}}}if(['length','current','area'].some(k=>c[k]===undefined||c[k]==='')){r.textContent='Omple llargada, corrent i secció per estimar la caiguda.';return}try{const v=voltageDrop({length:Number(c.length),current:Number(c.current),area:Number(c.area),voltage:Number(c.voltage??12)});r.textContent=`Caiguda estimada: ${v.drop.toFixed(3)} V · ${v.percent.toFixed(2)} % · dissipació ${v.watts.toFixed(2)} W. No és una validació del cable.`}catch(e){r.textContent=e.message}}
function updateScenario(){const s=scenario();$('#isolationSummary').textContent=config.transformer?'Transformador marí: PE de port i PE de bord separats a flotació. El secundari té referència N′–PE i diferencial propis. El soft-start no substitueix un SPD ni regula la tensió.':config.galvanic?'Connexió directa amb aïllador galvànic al PE. No és un transformador ni una protecció de sobretensions.':'Connexió directa: PE continu entre port i bord; sense aïllament galvànic afegit.';$('#scenarioResult').innerHTML=`<div class="status-line">Quadre DC: <b>${s.services?'amb alimentació':'general obert'}</b></div><div class="status-line">Sentina: <b>${s.bilge?'bomba activada':'aturada'}</b> <small>· ${esc(config.bilgeMode.toUpperCase())}${!config.main&&s.bilge?' · funciona amb el general OFF':''}</small></div><div class="status-line">Alarma de gas: <b>${s.gasAvailable?'alimentació permanent':'no instal·lada'}</b><br><small>La lògica mostra alimentació disponible; no simula detecció ni certifica l’alarma.</small></div><div class="status-line">Raspberry i webcams: <b>${s.computer?'amb alimentació':'inactius'}</b></div><div class="status-line">Fonts de càrrega habilitades: <b>${s.charging.length?esc(s.charging.join(' + ')):'cap'}</b><br><small>Connexió disponible; no es calcula la potència, el corrent real ni la regulació.</small></div>`;$('#compatibility').innerHTML=networkStatus(config).map(s=>`<div class="compat-item">${esc(s)}</div>`).join('');$('#profileSummary').textContent=`i40 ${config.instrument==='BidataWind'?'Bidata + Wind':config.instrument} · ${config.vhf==='gx2400'?'GX2400E GPS / AIS RX':config.vhf==='unknown'?'VHF pendent':config.vhf==='0183'?'VHF NMEA 0183':'VHF en xarxa'} · ${config.ais==='none'?'sense AIS':config.ais==='builtin'?'AIS integrat':'AIS extern'}`;}
function changePage(next){page=next;$$('.page').forEach(p=>p.hidden=p.id!==next);$$('[data-page]').forEach(b=>{if(b.dataset.page===next)b.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else b.removeAttribute('aria-current')});if(next==='list')renderList();}
function connectorArt(shape){const base='<svg viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="Dibuix esquemàtic de reconeixement, sense pinout"><g stroke="#446c69" stroke-width="2.5" fill="#d5e3d5">',end='</g></svg>';const wire='<path d="M0 60h68" stroke="#476e70" stroke-width="10"/>';
 const forms={ring:wire+'<rect x="68" y="47" width="55" height="26" rx="6"/><circle cx="153" cy="60" r="28"/><circle cx="153" cy="60" r="13" fill="#eef3ec"/>',spade:wire+'<rect x="68" y="47" width="44" height="26" rx="5"/><path d="M112 47h59v26h-59M123 50v20M162 50v20" fill="none"/>',st1:wire+'<path d="M70 37h74q19 0 19 23t-19 23H70Z"/><path d="M94 50v20m21-20v20m21-20v20" stroke="#102b35"/>',round:wire+'<rect x="68" y="39" width="58" height="42" rx="8"/><circle cx="155" cy="60" r="29"/><path d="M143 51h24m-24 18h24M155 40v8"/>',coax:wire+'<rect x="68" y="43" width="52" height="34" rx="3"/><path d="M75 44v31m8-31v31m8-31v31m8-31v31"/><rect x="120" y="47" width="35" height="26"/><path d="M155 60h30" stroke="#ae8251" stroke-width="6"/>',splice:'<path d="M0 60h240" stroke="#476e70" stroke-width="9"/><rect x="57" y="44" width="126" height="32" rx="9" fill="#bcd6bb"/><path d="M90 48v24m60-24v24"/>',solar:wire+'<rect x="68" y="43" width="82" height="34" rx="5"/><path d="M94 38v44m9-44v44m9-44v44"/><rect x="150" y="49" width="32" height="22"/>',shore:wire+'<rect x="68" y="34" width="70" height="52" rx="12" fill="#a9c7d7"/><circle cx="159" cy="60" r="32" fill="#bdd5e2"/><path d="M146 48v13m26-13v13m-13 6v12"/>',terminal:'<path d="M0 45h90m-90 30h90" stroke-width="7"/><rect x="90" y="28" width="75" height="64" rx="7"/><circle cx="127" cy="44" r="7"/><circle cx="127" cy="76" r="7"/><path d="M122 44h10m-10 32h10"/>'};return base+(forms[shape]||forms.round)+end;}
function renderConnectors(){$('#connectorGrid').innerHTML=connectors.map(c=>`<article class="connector-card">${connectorArt(c.shape)}<p class="eyebrow">${esc(c.family)}</p><h3>${esc(c.name)}</h3><p>${esc(c.desc)}</p><p class="check-note">${esc(c.check)}</p>${c.source?`<p class="small">${sourceLink(c.source)}</p>`:''}</article>`).join('')}
function renderList(){const es=activeEdges(config,$('#listLayer').value||undefined);$('#tableCaption').innerHTML=`<span data-user-text>${esc(config.profile)}</span> · ${es.length} connexions funcionals`;const head=['Codi / xarxa','Des de → fins a','Connectors / cable','Protecció / anotacions'].map(t=>esc(translate(t)));$('#connectionRows').innerHTML=es.map(e=>`<tr><td data-label="${head[0]}"><b>${esc(e.id)}</b><small>${esc(layers[e.layer].name)}</small></td><td data-label="${head[1]}">${esc(byId(e.from).name)} → ${esc(byId(e.to).name)}<small>${esc(e.a)} → ${esc(e.b)}</small></td><td data-label="${head[2]}">${esc(e.connector)}<small>${esc(e.cable)}</small><small>${esc(cableSpec(e).type)}</small><small>${esc(cableSpec(e).size)}</small><small>A: ${esc(cableSpec(e).connectorA)}</small><small>B: ${esc(cableSpec(e).connectorB)}</small>${config.cables[e.id]?`<small data-user-text>${esc(cableSummary(e.id,true))}</small>`:''}</td><td data-label="${head[3]}">${esc(e.protection)}<small data-user-text>${esc(config.notes[e.id]||'')}</small></td><td><button data-open-edge="${e.id}">Obre ↗</button></td></tr>`).join('');$$('[data-open-edge]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const e=byEdge(b.dataset.openEdge);changePage('atlas');routeKey='';$('#route').value='';switchLayer(e.layer);choose('edge',e.id,true)});$('#componentList').innerHTML=`<h3>Components presents al perfil</h3><p class="small">Blocs funcionals: un bloc pot agrupar diverses peces. Confirmar contingut dels kits abans de comprar cables o terminadors duplicats.</p><div>${modelNodes(config).filter(n=>enabled(n.condition,config)&&(!$('#listLayer').value||n.layer===$('#listLayer').value)).map(n=>`<span>${esc(n.name)}</span>`).join('')}</div>`;}
function cableSummary(id,localized=false){const c=config.cables[id]||{};return [['length','m anada'],['current','A'],['area','mm²'],['voltage','V'],['fuse','protecció prevista'],['percent','%'],['wireType',''],['gauge',''],['connectorA',''],['connectorB','']].filter(([k])=>c[k]!==undefined&&c[k]!=='').map(([k,u])=>`${c[k]} ${localized?translate(u):u}`).join(' · ');}
function download(name,data,type){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([data],{type})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
function syncFields(){if($('#ais'))$('#ais').disabled=config.vhf==='gx2400';for(const key of Object.keys(defaults)){const input=$('#'+key);if(input){if(input.type==='checkbox')input.checked=config[key];else input.value=config[key];}}}
for(const key of Object.keys(defaults)){const input=$('#'+key);if(!input)continue;input.addEventListener('change',()=>{config[key]=input.type==='checkbox'?input.checked:input.value;if(key==='vhf'){if(config.vhf==='gx2400')config.ais='builtin';else if(config.instrument==='BidataWind')config.networkBridge=true;syncFields()}if(key==='plotter'&&config.plotter){config.networkBridge=true;syncFields()}if(key==='networkBridge'&&!config.networkBridge){config.plotter=false;syncFields()}if(key==='transformer'&&config.transformer){config.galvanic=false;syncFields()}if(key==='galvanic'&&config.galvanic){config.transformer=false;syncFields()}save();if(routeKey){const r=routes()[routeKey];if(!routeSteps(r).length){routeKey='';$('#route').value='';step=0}else{step=Math.min(step,routeSteps(r).length-1);selected=routeSteps(r)[step];}}if(selected.type==='node'&&!enabled(byId(selected.id)?.condition,config))selected={type:'node',id:visibleNodes()[0].id};if(selected.type==='edge'&&!activeEdges(config).some(e=>e.id===selected.id))selected={type:'node',id:visibleNodes()[0].id};updateScenario();draw();showDetail();if(page==='list')renderList()});}
